ASSET CARVE-OUT — IMPORTANT

This MIT license covers the SOURCE CODE ONLY (everything under `src/`,
configuration files, and shell scripts).

The following directories are EXPLICITLY EXCLUDED from the MIT grant:

  * public/cards/   — ZUTOMAYO card scan artwork. Property of EARN-A-ROCK /
                      ZUTOMAYO. Used here under fair-use / fan-project
                      terms only; no license is granted to redistribute,
                      remix, or commercialize these files.

  * public/mat/     — Riso play-mat background imagery. Same terms as above.

  * public/sfx/     — Sound effect samples. Several clips are CC-BY 4.0 with
                      mandatory attribution; others are CC0. See
                      `public/sfx/CREDITS.txt` for the per-file breakdown
                      and the in-app `/credits` page for the runtime
                      attribution surface.

If you are a rights-holder for any excluded asset and would like it removed,
please open an issue on the repository and the asset will be removed.
